# Ecosystem

## Workspace

`~/ai/agents/refactoragent/` — local `plans/` only.

## Target repo

User attaches each session. Detect test command from project (Makefile, package.json scripts, pytest, cargo test, etc.).

## vs other agents

| Agent | Role |
|-------|------|
| **project-rescue** | Broken deps/control; system test gate; may write tests |
| **refactoragent** | Deliberate structure change; **never** edit tests |
| **makeitworkagent** (example) | Ship — may coexist; proceed if user says so |

## Status

Log when user ends session (shared-tracking). INDEX may show competing plans — proceed.

## Test file patterns (do not edit)

`**/test/**`, `**/tests/**`, `**/*_test.*`, `**/*.test.*`, `**/*.spec.*`, `**/__tests__/**`

If refactor requires test changes → stop and tell user to assign another agent.
